'''Age of Dinosaurs''' (恐竜時代, ''Kyōryū Jidai'', '''Dinosaur Era''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 2150.

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (Sm): Cat Base health is increased by 20%.

